### Story: Capture Athlete Observation

As a coach,
I want to create a note from my phone and link it to an athlete, team, or event,
so observations are captured before they are forgotten.

#### Acceptance Criteria
- Coach can create a note in under 3 required fields.
- Note requires body text and at least one context link: athlete, team, or event.
- Note records author, timestamp, and visibility level.
- Note appears on the athlete/team timeline after save.
- Audit event is created when note is created.
